  "operation_ids": [],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "`/verified` calls `GET /api/v1/work?queue=verified` (no other list call) and shows one row per returned item with title, line title, owner and \"Last updated\" \u2014 verify: run the mock, open `/verified` at 1440 px; the network log shows that one request; the column header reads \"Last updated\", and the words \"Verified at\" appear nowhere on the page.",
    "`/exceptions` calls `GET /api/v1/work?queue=exceptions` and no longer calls `GET /api/v1/exceptions` \u2014 verify: network log on `/exceptions`; `grep -rn \"api/v1/exceptions\" frontend/src` returns nothing.",
    "Line titles come from `lines[]`; a row whose key is missing from `lines[]` shows the key \u2014 verify: unit test of the adapter with both cases; page shows \"Finance ledger\", not `finance-ledger/v1`.",
    "Rows keep the server order and 8 per page; no rows-per-page control exists on either page \u2014 verify: page with 3 mock pages shows 8 rows then \"Show more\"; no page-size control in the DOM.",
    "\"Show more\" skips empty pages: with page 2 empty and `next_page` 3, one click adds page 3's rows \u2014 verify: adapter test (`tests/work-list.test.ts`) counts the requests (`page=2`, `page=3`); after more than 10 consecutive empty pages the button reads \"Keep looking\" and rows already shown stay.",
    "A first page that is empty with `next_page` set does not show the empty state; it keeps asking until rows or `next_page: null` \u2014 verify: adapter test.",
    "The empty state shows only when there are no rows and `next_page` is null \u2014 verify: persona with an empty list shows \"Nothing has been verified yet.\" on `/verified` and \"No exceptions right now.\" on `/exceptions`, desktop and 390 px; with a search that matches nothing the \"No \u2026 match your search.\" text and \"Clear search\" show instead.",
    "Coverage: `as_of` always shows; `limited: true` shows \"This list may be incomplete\u2026\"; non-empty `deferred` shows the deferred count line; no total, no \"of N\" and no \"0\" appears anywhere for an unknown count \u2014 verify: component test over the two fixtures above plus `limited:false,deferred:[]` (only the as-of line); text search of the rendered DOM for \" of \" counts and \"0 \" finds none.",
    "A null `owner` shows \"Unassigned\" on both pages; a present owner shows the name \u2014 verify: component test, both layouts.",
    "Exceptions state tags: `action_needed` shows \"Action needed\", `awaiting_reconciliation` shows \"Awaiting reconciliation\", `effect_uncertain` shows \"Effect uncertain\"; a row of any other state in the queue is shown with its own tag, not dropped \u2014 verify: component test per state; `tsc --noEmit` fails if a state is removed from the lookup.",
    "Each title links to `/work/{id}` with the integer id and never to `django_url` or `api_url` \u2014 verify: component test reads the `href` of every row and card; navigating from a row opens the work item route.",
    "\"Open output\" on a verified row reads `GET /work/{id}` and opens `output_url` in a new tab with `noopener noreferrer`; when `output_url` is null the row shows the \"No output file is attached\u2026\" note; when the read fails the row shows the retry message and the rest of the list is unchanged \u2014 verify: component tests with the three mock ids; only the pressed row changes.",
    "Rows with `sample: true` show the sample label on `/verified` \u2014 verify: component test and page at 1440 px.",
    "The line filter narrows with `line=<key>`, search sends `q`, and either restarts from page 1; a late answer from an earlier request does not replace newer rows \u2014 verify: adapter test with a delayed first response.",
    "Errors: 401 shows the signed-out state, 403 shows \"This list isn't open to your role.\" with no retry, a network or 5xx failure shows the error card with Try again and the text that nothing was changed; Try again reloads \u2014 verify: component tests per status (wrong user: mock persona with 403).",
    "A failed \"Show more\" keeps the rows shown and offers \"Try again\" \u2014 verify: adapter test.",
    "Phone (390 px): both pages show outlined cards with the title link over the card, search plus a filter icon opening a bottom sheet; no horizontal scroll \u2014 verify: Playwright or component test at 390 px; screenshot compared with `SCR-10-mobile` and `SCR-14-mobile`.",
    "Desktop (1440 px) layouts match `SCR-10-desktop` and `SCR-14-desktop` for the parts kept; each hidden part (see conflicts) is absent, with no blank column, empty chip or \"\u2014\" placeholder in its place \u2014 verify: screenshots at 1440 px; the design fidelity tool run once because the layout changes.",
    "Nothing writes: neither page issues a POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE \u2014 verify: network log on both pages while using search, filter, show more and open output.",
    "The adapter's public surface (`useWorkList`, row and page types, `coverageNotes`) is exported from `src/features/work-list/index.ts` with no import from `features/exceptions` or `features/verified`, so F-63 can use it unchanged \u2014 verify: `grep -rn \"features/exceptions\\|features/verified\" frontend/src/features/work-list` returns nothing; the adapter test passes `queue: 'needs_me'` and gets the same behaviour.",
    "New tests exist and pass: `tests/work-list.test.ts` (adapter), `tests/verified.test.tsx`, `tests/exceptions.test.tsx` rewritten, `tests/exceptions-mock.test.ts` rewritten against the live shape, a mock test that the live shape is returned only for `verified` and `exceptions`, and that `queue=done` still returns the v7 shape \u2014 verify: `npm test` in `frontend/`."
  ],
